    {
      "name": "HoverCard",
      "kind": "component",
      "description": "A preview of what a link points at: a citation's source, a person, a\ncommit. Opens after a short rest on the trigger with a mouse or keyboard\nfocus, stays open while the pointer or focus is inside it, and closes on\nEscape. Touch has no hover, so a tap follows the link: never put\ninformation only in the card.",
